#: share/html/Admin/Tools/RightsInspector.html:58
msgid ""
"The Rights Inspector lets you search your configured permissions based\n"
"on several different criteria. Each permission consists of a \"Principal\"\n"
"(which user, group, or role has the permission), an \"Object\" (what\n"
"record they have permissions on), and a \"Right\" (the name of the\n"
"permission). Rights Inspector lets you filter your permissions for any\n"
"combination of those three."
msgstr ""

